{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/40atxh","slideIndex":0,"text":"Source: user-supplied cali-allocation-blocks.pptx, slide 2, and subsequent user clarifications. This is a possible solution, not an assertion of an adopted AHTEG allocation formula. Equality Base is distinct from criterion B (DSI). The user requested teal for Equality Base plus criterion C through IUSAF, gold for Biodiversity Stewardship Index criteria A, B and D, and a grey IPBES Rapid Assessment process block feeding the index. No component weights, 50:50 split, country scores or disbursement mechanism are implied. DSI = digital sequence information."}